Source: ubu-dev-mentor
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/samkamer/ubuntu-packaging-mentor

Package: ubu-dev-mentor
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Recommends: licensecheck, apt-file, devscripts, quilt, patch
Description: AI-powered CLI mentor for Ubuntu/Debian packaging
 Automates copyright auditing, build-dependency detection, and changelog
 generation using a local LLM — with adaptive explanations for Beginner,
 MOTU, and CoreDev experience levels.
 .
 Agents included:
  * auditor     — generates DEP-5 debian/copyright via licensecheck
  * detective   — resolves Build-Depends from C/Python/Go source headers
  * scribe      — drafts debian/changelog entries from git log
  * patch_manager — applies AI-generated quilt patches
  * builder     — runs debuild and classifies build failures with AI
